AzeriteUI 5 - JuNNeZ Edition
============================

This is an unofficial fan edition of AzeriteUI 5 by GoldpawsStuff, maintained
with the original author's permission.

Two licences apply to what you are holding, and both must travel with any copy
of it. Neither one replaces the other.


1. The original AzeriteUI
-------------------------

AzeriteUI was created by Daniel Troconis and Lars Norberg (GoldpawsStuff). Its
code, design and artwork remain theirs, under their own licence, which is
reproduced in full in LICENSE.txt. Nothing in this file alters, replaces or
supersedes it.

Two things about that licence are worth repeating here, because they are easy to
miss and they still apply to this edition:

  * It covers the code only.

  * None of the artwork or media assets may be shared, modified, published or
    distributed in any shape or form. This applies to everything in Assets/,
    including art added by this edition, because that art is drawn from, and
    derived from, the original set. It is not covered by the MIT grant below.


2. The JuNNeZ Edition
---------------------

The changes and additions that make up this edition - the bug fixes,
compatibility work, new modules and the custom options panel - are the work of
Jonas "JuNNeZ" Andersen and are offered under the MIT licence below.

This grant covers those contributions as source code. It does not extend to the
original AzeriteUI code, which stays under LICENSE.txt, nor to any artwork or
media asset, which stays under the restriction quoted above.

